List every file in the workspace for the composer's fuzzy "@" picker.

Adds GET /v1/sessions/{id}/resources/environments/{env}/file-index (in
omnigent/runner/resource_routes.py, beside the file tree's routes), which
returns every file path in the session's workspace in one response, so the
web UI can match "@auth" against all of them as you type, as Claude Code's
and Codex's own pickers do. Inside a Git repository it lists what git
ls-files does (tracked plus untracked files that aren't ignored), and a
nested repository under its own ignores. Outside one it walks the tree,
skipping hidden folders, node_modules, .venv and symlinked folders. At most
50,000 paths, and "truncated" says when the list was cut short. Pairs with
the server patch 0011-mention-file-index.patch and the web patch
0014-composer-fuzzy-mentions.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).
